{"id":"c5296cb48c49c9a3","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-thm-diamond.md","title":"Diamond Implies CH","display":"thm-diamond — Diamond Implies CH","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-diamond","aliases":["58-thm-diamond"],"display":"thm-diamond — Diamond Implies CH","depends_on":["[[../batch20/58-df-diamond]]","[[58-df-cardinal-exponentiation]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-diamond"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-diamond</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-diamond — Diamond Implies CH"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d60e0a36bd259287\" href=\"?note=d60e0a36bd259287\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-diamond\">../batch20/58-df-diamond</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e9a96ab954b6013e\" href=\"?note=e9a96ab954b6013e\" title=\"58-df-cardinal-exponentiation\">58-df-cardinal-exponentiation</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\diamondsuit_{\\omega_1}\\in\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\diamondsuit_{\\omega_1}\\in\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}diamond\\text{-}ch} \\vdash \\diamondsuit_{\\omega_1}\\to 2^{\\aleph_0}=\\aleph_1\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}diamond\\text{-}ch} \\vdash \\diamondsuit_{\\omega_1}\\to 2^{\\aleph_0}=\\aleph_1\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The implication is specifically from <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\diamondsuit_{\\omega_1}\">\\(\\diamondsuit_{\\omega_1}\\)</span> to CH; higher-cardinal diamond principles have their own guessing consequences.</li>\n<li>This atom states a consequence of the diamond definition rather than duplicating that definition under a theorem filename.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch20/58-df-diamond","status":"resolved","id":"d60e0a36bd259287","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-diamond]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinal-exponentiation","status":"resolved","id":"e9a96ab954b6013e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-cardinal-exponentiation]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\diamondsuit_{\\omega_1}\\in\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}diamond\\text{-}ch} \\vdash \\diamondsuit_{\\omega_1}\\to 2^{\\aleph_0}=\\aleph_1","display":true},{"tex":"\\diamondsuit_{\\omega_1}","display":false}],"bytes":758,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4123","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-thm-diamond.md|58-thm-diamond]]（batch09）"}],"outgoing":["d60e0a36bd259287","e9a96ab954b6013e"]}